cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this workflow, please cite it as below."
title: "kwp-opendata-bayern: Reproducible open-data GIS workflow for municipal heat planning in Bavaria"
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Ivan
    family-names: Alonso
license: AGPL-3.0-only
repository-code: "https://github.com/ivan-alonso-rs/kwp-opendata-bayern"
version: 0.1.0-dev
keywords:
  - kommunale Wärmeplanung
  - municipal heat planning
  - GIS
  - PostGIS
  - LoD2
  - Zensus 2022
  - open data
  - Bavaria
abstract: >-
  Open-data workflow (LoD2, ALKIS, Zensus 2022) to estimate building heat demand
  with uncertainty, heat density per block and per street, and to validate the
  results against published municipal heat plans in Bavaria (case studies:
  Bubenreuth, Hemhofen). Developed with AI assistance (see AUTHORS.md).
